#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/history.html:79
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Invitation for <a href=\"%(href)s\">%(username)s</a> to join as organization"
" %(role_name)s expired"
msgstr ""
"Inbjudan till <a href=\"%(href)s\">%(username)s</a> att ansluta som "
"%(role_name)s i organisationen har löpt ut"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/history.html:89
#: warehouse/templates/manage/team/history.html:25
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(team_name)s team added as project %(role_name)s for <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\">%(project_name)s</a>"
msgstr ""
"Teamet %(team_name)s har lagts till som %(role_name)s för <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\">%(project_name)s</a>"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/history.html:93
#: warehouse/templates/manage/team/history.html:29
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(team_name)s team removed as project %(role_name)s for <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\">%(project_name)s</a>"
msgstr ""
"Teamet %(team_name)s har tagits bort som %(role_name)s för <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\">%(project_name)s</a>"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/history.html:97
#: warehouse/templates/manage/team/history.html:33
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(team_name)s team changed to project %(role_name)s for <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\">%(project_name)s</a>"
msgstr ""
"Teamet %(team_name)s har ändrats till %(role_name)s för <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\">%(project_name)s</a>"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/history.html:113
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Custom Trusted Publisher '%(issuer_type)s' for <code>%(issuer_url)s</code> "
"added to organization"
msgstr ""
"Anpassad betrodd utgivare '%(issuer_type)s' för <code>%(issuer_url)s</code> "
"har lagts till i organisationen"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/history.html:121
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Custom Trusted Publisher '%(issuer_type)s' for <code>%(issuer_url)s</code> "
"removed from organization"
msgstr ""
"Anpassad betrodd utgivare '%(issuer_type)s' för <code>%(issuer_url)s</code> "
"har tagits bort från organisationen"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/projects.html:78
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Get started by adding a project that you own using the form below. To learn "
"how to create a new project, visit the <a href=\"%(href)s\" "
"target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Python Packaging User Guide</a>"
msgstr ""
"Kom i gång genom att lägga till ett projekt som du äger med formuläret "
"nedan. Information om hur du skapar ett nytt projekt finns i <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">användarhandboken för "
"Python-paketering</a>"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/projects.html:102
msgid ""
"Transfer an existing project that you own, or create and add a new project "
"to the organization."
msgstr ""
"Överför ett befintligt projekt som du äger eller skapa och lägg till ett "
"nytt projekt i organisationen."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/projects.html:119
msgid ""
"Owners or managers of this organization can transfer a project that they own"
" to this organization if the project has not been added to another "
"organization. A project that has been added to another organization can be "
"transferred from the project settings page."
msgstr ""
"Ägare eller administratörer för denna organisation kan överföra ett projekt "
"som de äger till organisationen om projektet inte har lagts till i en annan "
"organisation. Ett projekt som har lagts till i en annan organisation kan "
"överföras från sidan med projektinställningar."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/projects.html:136
msgid ""
"Owners of this organization can create an empty project and add it to the "
"organization."
msgstr ""
"Ägare till denna organisation kan skapa ett tomt projekt och lägga till det "
"i organisationen."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/publishing.html:28
#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/publishing.html:137
#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/publishing.html:251
#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/publishing.html:325
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The project (on PyPI) that will be created and owned by the "
"'%(organization_name)s' organization when this publisher is used"
msgstr ""
"Projektet på PyPI som skapas och ägs av organisationen "
"'%(organization_name)s' när denna utgivare används"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/publishing.html:213
#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/publishing.html:198
msgid ""
"The GitLab instance URL. Select <code>https://gitlab.com</code> for the "
"public GitLab service, or a custom instance."
msgstr ""
"Webbadressen till GitLab-instansen. Välj <code>https://gitlab.com</code> för"
" den publika GitLab-tjänsten eller en anpassad instans."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/publishing.html:395
msgid ""
"<strong>Tip:</strong> Trusted publishers created here will be owned by this "
"organization when the project is created. Organization owners can manage "
"these publishers and their associated projects."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Tips:</strong> Betrodda utgivare som skapas här ägs av denna "
"organisation när projektet skapas. Organisationens ägare kan hantera dessa "
"utgivare och deras kopplade projekt."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/publishing.html:403
msgid ""
"Pending publishers are trusted publishers for projects that do not exist "
"yet. They can be used to create a new project on first upload."
msgstr ""
"Väntande utgivare är betrodda utgivare för projekt som ännu inte finns. De "
"kan användas för att skapa ett nytt projekt vid den första uppladdningen."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/roles.html:28
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Use this page to control which PyPI users can help you to manage "
"'%(organization_name)s'."
msgstr ""
"Använd denna sida för att styra vilka PyPI-användare som kan hjälpa dig att "
"hantera '%(organization_name)s'."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/roles.html:39
#, python-format
msgid ""
"There are %(number_of_roles)s possible roles for people in this "
"organization. Refer to the following matrix for details on what each role "
"can do."
msgstr ""
"Det finns %(number_of_roles)s möjliga roller för personer i denna "
"organisation. I matrisen nedan finns information om vad varje roll kan göra."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/roles.html:366
msgid ""
"Accepted invitations will result in an additional $5 per user per month "
"billing charge."
msgstr ""
"Godkända inbjudningar medför en extra avgift på 5 USD per användare och "
"månad."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/roles.html:378
msgid ""
"You have exceeded your seat limit. Invited members can still accept "
"invitations."
msgstr ""
"Du har överskridit platsgränsen. Inbjudna medlemmar kan fortfarande godkänna"
" inbjudningar."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/roles.html:386
msgid ""
"This organization does not have an active subscription yet. You may only "
"invite a <strong>Billing Manager</strong> until billing is activated."
msgstr ""
"Denna organisation har ännu ingen aktiv prenumeration. Du kan bara bjuda in "
"en <strong>faktureringsansvarig</strong> tills faktureringen har aktiverats."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/settings.html:138
#, python-format
msgid ""
"If you need to convert your organization account from a Company account to a"
" Community account, you can email <a href=\"mailto:%(email)s\">%(email)s</a>"
" to communicate with %(site)s administrators."
msgstr ""
"Om du behöver ändra organisationskontot från ett företagskonto till ett "
"gemenskapskonto kan du skicka e-post till <a "
"href=\"mailto:%(email)s\">%(email)s</a> för att kontakta administratörerna "
"för %(site)s."
